<p aria-level="1" class="pageTitle" role="heading" style="margin-left: 20px;">2026 General Election Official Candidate List</p>
<div class="mainContent" style="min-height:100%; margin-left: 36px; margin-right: 20px; word-wrap: break-word; background: #ffffff;"> <p>*This list is official and reflects what was certified to the counties on September 4.</p>
<p>*A candidate&#8217;s name that is stricken through has withdrawn.</p>
<p>*Certified write in candidates are not listed on the ballot; however, voters may write the candidate&#8217;s name on the ballot in the appropriate space provided in order to cast a vote for that candidate.</p>
<p><img alt="" border="0" height="19" src="../../images/general/excel.png" style="vertical-align: text-top;" width="16"/> <a href="files/2026/2026GeneralCandidateListOfficial.xlsx">Excel version (XLSX)</a></p>
